flowchart LR
  A[Create Listing] --> B[Choose Listing Type]
  B --> C[Enter Property Details]
  C --> D[REGA / License Validation]
  D --> E{Publish Now?}
  E -->|Insufficient Credits| DR[Draft: Insufficient Credits]
  E -->|Saved, not submitted| DR2[Draft: Not Posted]
  E -->|Yes| F[Listing Live]
  DR --> F
  DR2 --> F
  F --> G[Views and Clicks]
  G --> H[Leads]
  H --> I[Tasks and Follow-up]
  F --> J[Credits / Upgrades]
  J --> G
  F --> K{License Expires or Deleted}
  K -->|Ad License Expired| L[Removed: Ad License Expired]
  K -->|Manually Deleted| M[Removed: Deleted]
  L --> N[Publish Now to Relist]
  M --> N
